{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"zhonghua-e-o135","title":"华歆为诸生时宿人门外，主人妇夜产；两吏诣门相谓公在此，籍当定奈何得住，乃前向歆拜；出共语当与几岁，一人曰当三岁；后三岁往问儿消息果已死，歆乃自知当为公","accounts":[{"id":"zhonghua-a-e1f3f3ab79bba26bc1c7","label":"裴注·列异传","text":"《列异》记华歆宿门鬼吏故事；裴松之指出《晋阳秋》魏舒寄宿事亦如之，认为传者不同而选信《列异》。","evidence":["zhonghua-q-01699363608665af2bb0","zhonghua-q2-45987d73da58d1c2dc85"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0340","role":"被吏拜、后自知当为公者","evidence":["zhonghua-q-01699363608665af2bb0"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["zhonghua-q-01699363608665af2bb0"]},"ordering_evidence":"zhonghua-q-01699363608665af2bb0","source_order":[13,203,11],"order":2891}],"persons":[{"id":"wudi-p0340","name":"华歆","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"zhonghua-q-01699363608665af2bb0","section":"chapter-013","block":"b-05aa02616a1e982d0eb3","layer":"pei","quote":"歆为诸生时，尝宿人门外。主人妇，夜产。有顷，两吏诣门，便辟易却，相谓曰：‘公在此。’踌躇良久，一吏曰：‘籍当定，奈何得住？’乃前向歆拜，相将入。出，并行，共语曰：‘当与几岁？’一人曰：‘当三岁。’天明，歆去。后欲验其事，至三岁，故往问儿消息，果已死。歆乃自知当为公。”","attribution":"裴注·列异传","section_title":"钟繇华歆王朗传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0031.xhtml","index":202,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-7ea38e1405d4f66972a3","start":11,"end":145,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhonghua-q2-45987d73da58d1c2dc85","section":"chapter-013","block":"b-53845975ccd0ff5fb523","layer":"pei","quote":"臣松之按《晋阳秋》，说魏舒少时寄宿事，亦如之；以为理无二人俱有此事，将由传者不同。今宁信《列异》。","attribution":"裴注（引书见原文）","section_title":"钟繇华歆王朗传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0031.xhtml","index":203,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-7ea38e1405d4f66972a3","start":0,"end":49,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
